      "query": "cat << 'EOF' > /tmp/calc.py\ndata = [\n    (0.057, 1271),\n    (0.059, 1312),\n    (0.058, 1192),\n    (0.056, 1500),\n    (0.045, 1739),\n    (0.046, 1399),\n    (0.046, 1524),\n    (0.047, 1643),\n]\nn_tot = sum(n for _, n in data)\ng_tot = sum(r * n for r, n in data)\nprint(f\"rate = {g_tot / n_tot}\")\nEOF\npython3 /tmp/calc.py",
